     A*----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* DKICUSP  : Master Data Nasabah
     A* Desc    : Bank DKI - customer master, key CUSID
     A* Author  : jelly.amna
     A* Date    : 22-10-2026
     A*----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R DKICUSF                   TEXT('DKI - Master Nasabah')
     A            CUSID          7P 0       TEXT('ID Nasabah')
     A                                      COLHDG('ID' 'Nasabah')
     A            CUSNAM        40A         TEXT('Nama Nasabah')
     A                                      COLHDG('Nama' 'Nasabah')
     A            CUSALM        60A         TEXT('Alamat')
     A                                      COLHDG('Alamat')
     A            CUSTLP        15A         TEXT('No Telepon')
     A                                      COLHDG('No' 'Telepon')
     A          K CUSID
